#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.le:1 of
msgid "Element-wise less-than-or-equal comparison."
msgstr "逐元素小于等于比较。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.le:3 of
msgid ""
"Bound to the ``<=`` operator (``__le__``), so ``lf <= other`` is "
"equivalent to ``lf.le(other)`` for non-LiteFrame ``other``."
msgstr ""
"绑定到 ``<=`` 运算符（``__le__``），因此对于非 LiteFrame 的 ``other``，``"
"lf <= other`` 等价于 ``lf.le(other)``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.le of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.le:6 of
msgid "Value or LiteFrame to compare against."
msgstr "用于比较的值或 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.le of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.le:9 of
msgid "Lazy boolean LiteFrame indicating where elements are <= ``other``."
msgstr "惰性布尔 LiteFrame，指示元素小于等于 ``other`` 的位置。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.le of
msgid "返回类型"
